# Build context for isi_gateway/Dockerfile. The gateway image only needs
# pyproject.toml, README.md, backbone/ and isi_gateway/ — allowlist those and
# exclude everything else so the context stays tiny (the repo carries ~47GB
# under trainer/ + ~2GB under archive/ that must never enter the build).
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!backbone
!isi_gateway
